mx4ctl (0.6.0~resolute1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First upload to ppa:stzahi/logi-mx4-ring.
  * Actions ring on the thumb button, in place of the old popup menu:
    buttons spiral out around the cursor, dials for brightness and volume,
    a microphone toggle, and a drawn icon set.
  * Ask KWin for the pointer position on Wayland, where a client may
    neither locate it nor place a window.

